<title>INDIA: INDIA'S RBI NET DLR PURCHASES AT $1.33 BLN IN JUNE.</title>
<headline>INDIA'S RBI NET DLR PURCHASES AT $1.33 BLN IN JUNE.</headline>
<dateline>BOMBAY 1997-08-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Reserve Bank of India (RBI) said its net dollar purchases in June 1997 were $1.33 billion.</p>
<p>This was worth 47.39 billion rupees at the contracted rate, the RBI's August 1997 bulletin said.</p>
<p>RBI said it bought $1.83 billion in June and sold $493 million.</p>
<p>Outstanding net forward dollar sales in June were $158 million, the bulletin said.</p>
<p>-- Bombay newsroom (91)-22-265 9000</p>
</text>
